From 400c771111fa4fc376942926d0f6538d018e723d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian MacDonald <ian@netstatz.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 19:55:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 092/104] fix(onnxruntime): a missing ort-server engine does
 not evict other models

The install step ran before the start-failure handling, so an engine that
could not be installed (offline with no binary, or a failed download)
threw a plain runtime_error and the router evicted every resident model
before trying again. The install failure is now non-retryable too.

test_512d now skips without the fake backend and registers its model
itself.

Assisted-by: claude:opus-5.5
